      "content": "DNS changes can take anywhere from 1 hour to 48 hours to propagate globally because different servers cache IP addresses for varying lengths. You can't speed up the actual propagation process, but you can try adding a `NSlookup` command or using a speed test service to check your own local cache and see if the change is visible immediately. For immediate updates without waiting for full propagation, you might need to implement a load balancer with HTTP redirects instead.",
